@ANP.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5250
@api = {{ANP.API_HostAddress}}/api

### Products: list the catalog
GET {{api}}/products
Accept: application/json

### Products: look up a code (200) — used by the frontend validateHttp validator
GET {{api}}/products/ACME-001
Accept: application/json

### Products: unknown code (404)
GET {{api}}/products/NOPE-999
Accept: application/json

### Invoices: list all
GET {{api}}/invoices
Accept: application/json

### Invoices: list filtered by status (Draft | Sent | Paid)
GET {{api}}/invoices?status=Sent
Accept: application/json

### Invoices: get one by id
GET {{api}}/invoices/1
Accept: application/json

### Invoices: create (named request so the id can be reused below)
# @name createInvoice
POST {{api}}/invoices
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerName": "Initech LLC",
  "issueDate": "2026-06-21",
  "status": "Draft",
  "taxRate": 0.20,
  "notes": "Net 30.",
  "lineItems": [
    { "productCode": "ACME-001", "description": "Widget", "quantity": 10, "unitPrice": 19.99 },
    { "productCode": "SVC-HOUR", "description": "Consulting (hour)", "quantity": 4, "unitPrice": 120.00 }
  ]
}

### Invoices: update the invoice just created (reuses its id from the response above)
PUT {{api}}/invoices/{{createInvoice.response.body.$.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerName": "Initech LLC",
  "issueDate": "2026-06-21",
  "status": "Sent",
  "taxRate": 0.10,
  "notes": "Sent to customer.",
  "lineItems": [
    { "productCode": "ACME-002", "description": "Gadget", "quantity": 2, "unitPrice": 49.50 }
  ]
}

### Invoices: delete the invoice just created
DELETE {{api}}/invoices/{{createInvoice.response.body.$.id}}

### OpenAPI document (Development only)
GET {{ANP.API_HostAddress}}/openapi/v1.json
Accept: application/json
